n-PNIO\n-WiMAX ASN CP\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n@@ -231,13 +83,11 @@ There is no new or updated capture file support in this release.\n \n === Updated File Format Decoding Support\n \n-// There is no updated file format support in this release.\n+There is no updated file format support in this release.\n // Add one file type per line between the -- delimiters.\n-[commaize]\n---\n-BLF\n-RBM\n---\n+// [commaize]\n+// --\n+// --\n \n \n // === New and Updated Capture Interfaces support\n@@ -249,7 +99,8 @@ RBM\n This document only describes the changes introduced in Wireshark {wireshark-version}.\n You can find release notes for prior versions at the following locations:\n \n-* https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/wireshark-3.6.20.html[Wireshark 3.6.21]\n+* https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/wireshark-3.6.22.html[Wireshark 3.6.22]\n+* https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/wireshark-3.6.21.html[Wireshark 3.6.21]\n * https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/wireshark-3.6.20.html[Wireshark 3.6.20]\n * https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/wireshark-3.6.19.html[Wireshark 3.6.19]\n * https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/wireshark-3.6.18.html[Wireshark 3.6.18]\n",
